Let $N = 8888_{10}$. To convert $N$ to base-8, we repeatedly divide by 8 and record the remainders.
\begin{align*} 8888 &= 1111 \cdot 8 + 0 \\ 1111 &= 138 \cdot 8 + 7 \\ 138 &= 17 \cdot 8 + 2 \\ 17 &= 2 \cdot 8 + 1 \\ 2 &= 0 \cdot 8 + 2 \end{align*}
The remainders in reverse order are $2, 1, 2, 7, 0$. So $8888_{10} = 21270_8$.
The sum of the digits in base 8 is $2 + 1 + 2 + 7 + 0 = 12$.

\boxed{12}

